[
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0800-0701/bce-0709.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-001",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p001",
    "quote": "韓之先與周同姓，姓姬氏。其後苗裔事晉，得封於韓原，曰韓武子。武子後三世有韓厥，從封姓為韓氏。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0583.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-5",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-002",
    "number": 5,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p002",
    "quote": "韓厥，晉景公之三年，晉司寇屠岸賈將作亂，誅靈公之賊趙盾。趙盾已死矣，欲誅其子趙朔。韓厥止賈，賈不聽。厥告趙朔令亡。朔曰：「子必能不絕趙祀，死不恨矣。」韓厥許之。及賈誅趙氏，厥稱疾不出。程嬰、公孫杵臼之藏趙孤趙武也，厥知之。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0589.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-003",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p003",
    "quote": "景公十一年，厥與郤克將兵八百乘伐齊，敗齊頃公于鞍，獲逢丑父。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0588.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-10",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-004",
    "number": 10,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p003",
    "quote": "於是晉作六卿，而韓厥在一卿之位，號為獻子。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0583.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-5",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-005",
    "number": 5,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p004",
    "quote": "晉景公十七年，病，卜大業之不遂者為祟。韓厥稱趙成季之功，今後無祀，以感景公。景公問曰：「尚有世乎？」厥於是言趙武，而復與故趙氏田邑，續趙氏祀。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0566.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-7",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-006",
    "number": 7,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p005",
    "quote": "晉悼公之（十）［七］年，韓獻子老。獻子卒，子宣子代。宣字徙居州。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0544.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-14",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-007",
    "number": 14,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p006",
    "quote": "晉平公十四年，吳季札使晉，曰：「晉國之政卒歸於韓、魏、趙矣。」",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0514.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-5",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-008",
    "number": 5,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p006",
    "quote": "晉頃公十二年，韓宣子與趙、魏共分祁氏、羊舌氏十縣。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0497.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-7",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-009",
    "number": 7,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p006",
    "quote": "晉定公十五年，宣子與趙簡子侵伐范、中行氏。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0514.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-5",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-010",
    "number": 5,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p006",
    "quote": "宣子卒，子貞子代立。貞子徙居平陽。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0453.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-011",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p007",
    "quote": "貞子卒，子簡子代。簡子卒，子莊子代。莊子卒，子康子代。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0453.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-012",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p007",
    "quote": "康子與趙襄子、魏桓子共敗知伯，分其地，地益大，大於諸侯。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0424.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-013",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p008",
    "quote": "康子卒，子武子代。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0423.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-014",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p008",
    "quote": "武子二年，伐鄭，殺其君幽公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0409.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-015",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p008",
    "quote": "十六年，武子卒，子景侯立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": true
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0408.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-4",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-016",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p009",
    "quote": "景侯虔元年，伐鄭，取雍丘。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0407.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-017",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p009",
    "quote": "二年，鄭敗我負黍。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0403.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-018",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p010",
    "quote": "六年，與趙、魏俱得列為諸侯。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0400.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-019",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p011",
    "quote": "九年，鄭圍我陽翟。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0400.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-4",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-020",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p011",
    "quote": "景侯卒，子列侯取立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": true
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0397.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-021",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p012",
    "quote": "列侯三年，聶政殺韓相俠累。",
    "reused_existing_quote": true
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0391.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-022",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p012",
    "quote": "九年，秦伐我宜陽，取六邑。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0387.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-023",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p012",
    "quote": "十三年，列侯卒，子文侯立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": true
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0396.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-024",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p012",
    "quote": "是歲魏文侯卒。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0385.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-025",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p013",
    "quote": "文侯二年，伐鄭，取陽城。伐宋，到彭城，執宋君。",
    "reused_existing_quote": true
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0380.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-026",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p013",
    "quote": "七年，伐齊，至桑丘。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0380.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-027",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p013",
    "quote": "鄭反晉。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0378.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-028",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p013",
    "quote": "九年，伐齊，至靈丘。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0377.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-029",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p013",
    "quote": "十年，文侯卒，子哀侯立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": true
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0376.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-030",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p014",
    "quote": "哀侯元年，與趙、魏分晉國。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0375.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-031",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p014",
    "quote": "二年，滅鄭，因徙都鄭。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0374.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-8",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-032",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p015",
    "quote": "六年，韓嚴弒其君哀侯。而子懿侯立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": true
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0369.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-5",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-033",
    "number": 5,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p016",
    "quote": "懿侯二年，魏敗我馬陵。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0366.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-034",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p016",
    "quote": "五年，與魏惠王會宅陽。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0362.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-4",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-035",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p016",
    "quote": "九年，魏敗我澮。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0358.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-036",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p016",
    "quote": "十二年，懿侯卒，子昭侯立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0358.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-037",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p017",
    "quote": "昭侯元年，秦敗我西山。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0357.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-6",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-038",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p017",
    "quote": "二年，宋取我黃池。魏取朱。",
    "reused_existing_quote": true
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0353.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-7",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-039",
    "number": 7,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p017",
    "quote": "六年，伐東周，取陵觀、邢丘。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0351.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-040",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p018",
    "quote": "八年，申不害相韓，修術行道，國內以治，諸侯不來侵伐。",
    "reused_existing_quote": true
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0348.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-041",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p019",
    "quote": "十年，韓姬弒其君悼公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0348.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-042",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p019",
    "quote": "十一年，昭侯如秦。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0337.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-043",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p019",
    "quote": "二十二年，申不害死。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0335.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-044",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p019",
    "quote": "二十四年，秦來拔我宜陽。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0334.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-4",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-045",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p020",
    "quote": "二十五年，旱，作高門。屈宜臼曰：「昭侯不出此門。何也？不時。吾所謂時者，非時日也，人固有利不利時。昭侯嘗利矣，不作高門。往年秦拔宜陽，今年旱，昭侯不以此時卹民之急，而顧益奢，此謂『時絀舉贏』。」",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0333.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-046",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p020",
    "quote": "二十六年，高門成，昭侯卒，果不出此門。子宣惠王立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0328.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-047",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p021",
    "quote": "宣惠王五年，張儀相秦。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0325.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-048",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p021",
    "quote": "八年，魏敗我將韓舉。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0323.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-049",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p021",
    "quote": "十一年，君號為王。",
