    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p021",
    "quote": "與趙會區鼠。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0319.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-051",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p021",
    "quote": "十四，秦伐敗我鄢。",
