    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-067",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p028",
    "quote": "十四年，與齊、魏王共擊秦，至函谷而軍焉。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
