    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-068",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p028",
    "quote": "十六年，秦與我河外及武遂。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
