    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p029",
    "quote": "釐王三年，使公孫喜率周、魏攻秦。秦敗我二十四萬，虜喜伊闕。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0291.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
