    "note_anchor": "note-4",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-074",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p029",
    "quote": "十二年，與秦昭王會西周而佐秦攻齊。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0284.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-075",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p029",
    "quote": "齊敗，湣王出亡。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0282.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-076",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p029",
    "quote": "十四年，與秦會兩周閒。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0275.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-077",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p029",
    "quote": "二十一年，使暴捐救魏，為秦所敗，捐走開封。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0273.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj045-cite-078",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷045-韩世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p030",
    "quote": "二十三年，趙、魏攻我華陽。韓告急於秦，秦不救。韓相國謂陳筮曰：「事急，願公雖病，為一宿之行。」陳筮見穰侯。穰侯曰：「事急乎？故使公來。」陳筮曰：「未急也。」穰侯怒曰：「是可以為公之主使乎？夫冠蓋相望，告敝邑甚急，公來言未急，何也？」陳筮曰：「彼韓急則將變而佗從，以未急，故復來耳。」穰侯曰：「公無見王，請今發兵救韓。」八日而至，敗趙、魏於華陽之下。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
